   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "HERD MENTALITY\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 10, CC 97 to 112\n   1 Herd mentality\n   2 Who leads the herd\n   3 Dissenter\n   4 Group pressure\n   5 The crowd turns\n   6 The lone voice wins them over\n   7 Copying the others\n   8 A rumor spreads\n   9 The quiet majority\n  10 The group's inside joke\n  11 Earning a place in the group\n  12 The leader's right hand\n  13 Everyone watches, nobody helps\n  14 Blaming one of their own\n  15 suite: A mob forms\n  16 suite: The lone voice\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 11, CC 1 to 16\n   1 suite: Mob rule\n   2 suite: One against many\n   3 suite: The silent room\n   4 suite: Getting in\n   5 suite: Turning on one of their own\n   6 pair: When someone defies the group, the pressure rises\n   7 pair: When the herd grows, doubts go quiet\n   8 pair: When one loud voice leads the group, the pressure to agree builds\n   9 pair: When a rumor spreads further, the crowd turns\n  10 pair: When the rumor becomes a monster, the pressure builds\n  11 pair: When people copy each other more, the herd moves as one\n  12 pair: When the crowd turns, someone speaks up\n  13 pair: When someone openly defies the group, they start to win them over\n  14 pair: When the lone voice wins them over, the crowd turns\n  15 pair: When most keep quiet, the pressure grows\n  16 pair: When one voice breaks the silence, the crowd turns\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 11, CC 17 to 29\n   1 pair: When the joke shuts someone out, they stand out more\n   2 pair: When the way in is a cruel act, guilt follows\n   3 pair: When the leader grows stronger, the right hand grows more loyal\n   4 pair: When the right hand doubts out loud, the leader weakens\n   5 pair: When the least likely person helps, the others follow\n   6 pair: When a rumor spreads, the group finds someone to blame\n   7 pair: When the group feels shame later, guilt comes\n   8 pair: When everyone just watches, shame follows\n   9 pair: When someone bursts into song, the people around join in\n  10 pair: When everyone sees the embarrassing moment, it becomes the story of the night\n  11 pairs: The group closes ranks\n  12 pairs: From rumor to rally\n  13 pairs: Silence in the crowd"
   },
